<title>PAKISTAN: TENNIS-IRAN BEAT PAKISTAN IN DAVIS CUP TIE.</title>
<headline>TENNIS-IRAN BEAT PAKISTAN IN DAVIS CUP TIE.</headline>
<dateline>ISLAMABAD 1997-02-23</dateline>
<text>
<p>Iran completed a 3-2 win over</p>
<p>Pakistan in their Davis Cup Asia/Oceania zone group two first</p>
<p>round tie after victory in the first reverse singles on Sunday.</p>
<p>Results:</p>
<p>Ramin Raziani (Iran) beat Umer Rashid (Pakistan) 4-6 6-3 6-2</p>
<p>6-4</p>
<p>Hamidul Haq (Pakistan) beat Mansour Beherami (Iran) 1-6 6-4 6-2</p>
<p>(match reduced to best-of-three sets)</p>
<p>Result of Saturday's doubles:</p>
<p>Ramin Raziani/Mansour Beherami (Iran) beat Umer Rashid/Asim</p>
<p>Shafik (Pakistan) 6-3 7-5 7-6 (7-3)</p>
</text>
